    <bpmn:process id="W_W5091" name="W5091. Document Scanning, Archiving &amp; Large-Format Digitization Service" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer scan/digitize order (paper→digital)
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~hundreds–thousands of scans/month at maturity
Owner: Reprographics Operator / Store Services Lead
Participants: Operator, Counter Associate, IT (file delivery — VS-27), Privacy (VS-91)
Source: workflow W5091 — Document Scanning, Archiving &amp; Large-Format Digitization Service</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5091_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5091_Lane1" name="Counter Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5091_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5091_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5091_Lane2" name="Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5091_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5091_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5091_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5091_Start4" name="Customer scan/digitize order (paper→digital)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5091_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5091_Task5" name="Intake &amp; prepare: receive physical documents, condition check, capture scan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Intake &amp; prepare: receive physical documents, condition check, capture scan specs (DPI/color/format), and the attestation/consent (W5087/RA 10173)
Responsible (R): Counter Associate / Operator
Accountable (A): Store Services Lead
Duration: Per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5091_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5091_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5091_Task6" name="Scan &amp; QA: large-format scan, inspect output…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Scan &amp; QA: large-format scan, inspect output (resolution/completeness/legibility), OCR where requested, and re-scan defects
Responsible (R): Operator / Quality
Accountable (A): Store Services Lead
Duration: Per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5091_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5091_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5091_Task7" name="Deliver &amp; retain: deliver digital file (secure transfer W5086), archive per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Deliver &amp; retain: deliver digital file (secure transfer W5086), archive per retention (W5093/W5100), and return/secure-dispose originals per customer instruction (W5100)
Responsible (R): Operator / IT / Privacy
Accountable (A): Store Services Lead
Duration: Per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5091_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5091_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5091_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5091_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-759 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Reprographics Job Lifecycle (PA-176.2).) | - CTL-759: consent captured (VS-91); QA before delivery; secure delivery/disposal (W5100); chain-of-custody
Owner: Reprographics Operator / Store Services Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
